d_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-10T20:09:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T20:09:28Z"},{"id":628888036,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4lfBHk","name":"stable-win-x64-Gloomberb.tar.zst","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":307103005,"digest":"sha256:4566ef4867200620b0d5f8c1fe83af77a7c94184ac510a6ab44df5b338da84f8","download_count":7,"created_at":"2026-10-10T20:09:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T20:09:28Z"},{"id":628888026,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4lfBHa","name":"stable-win-x64-GloomberbSetup.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdos-program","state":"uploaded","size":284470045,"digest":"sha256:461d3cf2e23d9d7fb7bb0bc4a8aabb3b23faa53ce39ae6927762a9844aa27dc4","download_count":23,"created_at":"2026-10-10T20:09:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T20:09:28Z"},{"id":628888034,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4lfBHi","name":"stable-win-x64-update.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":73,"digest":"sha256:47cd2457e5c4c65f2c097e7e8a2e4b10211b2e2f2088f06d8d6ef3d91541abaa","download_count":12,"created_at":"2026-10-10T20:09:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T20:09:15Z"}],"body":"## Highlights\n\n- **Assistants can drive the terminal.** `MCP` in the command bar connects Claude Code, Codex or Cursor to Gloom, and an assistant connected to Gloom Cloud with Terminal control can operate the open terminal or desktop app. (#1530, #1532)\n- **Built-ins you can switch off.** Market Overview, Macro and Ticker Research are split into smaller plugins, and the Plugins pane (`PL`) shows what Gloomberb is made of, with starter packs. A switched-off plugin's panes stay in your layout. (#1528, #1533, #1535, #1540, #1547, #1553)\n- **A calmer Ask Gloom.** The question field has the keyboard from the first moment, each source reads as one line, and you can rate an answer with a thumbs up or down. (#1517, #1512, #1549)\n- **Options in the terminal.** `OMON` picks strikes by window or delta band and ranks LEAPS across symbols, `--expiration` takes a date, and `OSA` sizes a hedge budget. (#1522, #1518, #1524, #1562, #1563)\n- **The regular close, plainly.** Quotes, boards, portfolio and the header SPY headline the regular-session close with the after-hours print on its own line, and every report footer says how delayed the data is. (#1555, #1578, #1557)\n- **Move a pane to a layout of its own.** Give a chart or research pane the whole window, and move it back later. (#1527)\n- **IBKR sign-ins.** The Brokers pane says why a sign-in ended and shows when it ends, and Connect renews it early. (#1565)\n\n## Also in this release\n\n- Heat map: colour by session, an honest board age, labels on the largest tiles. (#1569, #1516)\n- Colour-blind safe themes, a list of theme ids, and chart lines you can tell apart without colour. (#1521)\n- Global listings: FX pairs in any spelling, Hong Kong four-digit codes, Gulf and Tel Aviv sessions, a foreign listing's own earnings and filings. (#1507, #1551, #1513, #1571, #1508, #1514, #1515)\n- Data: a stock split filed twice counts once, the economic calendar starts today, `AUCT` searches by benchmark and CUSIP. (#1552, #1554, #1582)\n- Newcomers: six dead ends in the CLI and terminal are fixed. (#1559)\n- Chat: find channels and DMs in the command bar. (#1531)\n\n[Full diff](https://github.com/gloom-sh/gloomberb/compare/v0.16.3...v0.16.4)\n","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}
